Name":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["전화 통화에서 가장 중요한 것은 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"차분함"}],"입니다. 민지 씨는 YES 수업에서 배운 대로 \"Please speak a little slower\" 대신 \"Could you repeat the information one more time?\"처럼 정중하게 요청하며 통화 흐름을 놓치지 않았습니다."]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-1",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"2. 의사 앞에서 증상 명확하게 설명하는 꿀팁"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2026-01-25-medical-appointment-english-1-h2-2.jpg","alt":"2. 의사 앞에서 증상 명확하게 설명하는 꿀팁","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[10px] border border-gray-100 w-full h-auto shadow-none"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 italic","children":"2. 의사 앞에서 증상 명확하게 설명하는 꿀팁"}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["진료실에 들어서는 순간이 영어로 말하기의 '결전의 순간'입니다. 의사는 정확한 진단을 위해 환자에게 증상의 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"정도, 위치, 양상, 지속 시간"}],"을 매우 구체적으로 물어봅니다. 단순히 '아프다(I hurt)'라고 말하는 것은 부족합니다."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"민지 씨는 복통을 설명할 때 다음과 같은 구체적인 표현을 사용했습니다."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 text-yes-blue","children":"✅ 증상과 통증을 묘사하는 핵심 구문"}],"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",["$","div",null,{"className":"my-6 w-full overflow-y-auto rounded-[10px] border border-gray-200","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full","children":[["$","thead",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200","children":["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","th",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"통증의 종류 (Pain Type)"}],["$","th",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":"설명 예시 (Specific Example)"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"className":"divide-y divide-gray-100","children":[["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Sharp"}]," (날카로운, 찌르는 듯한)"]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["\"I have a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"sharp, stabbing pain"}]," on my right side.\""]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Dull / Aching"}]," (둔한, 욱신거리는)"]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["\"I have a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"dull ache"}]," that spreads across my stomach.\""]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Burning"}]," (타는 듯한)"]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["\"I feel a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"burning sensation"}]," in my chest after eating.\""]}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Cramping"}]," (쥐어짜는 듯한)"]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-4 py-3 text-gray-700","style":{"textAlign":"left"},"children":["\"The pain comes and goes like a severe ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"cramp"}],".\""]}]]}]]}]]}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"통증이 언제, 어떻게 시작되었는지 시간의 흐름을 설명하는 것도 중요합니다."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-6 ml-6 list-disc [&>li]:mt-2 marker:text-yes-blue","children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"The pain ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"started suddenly"}]," two hours ago.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"It ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"started gradually"}]," three days ago and has been getting worse.\""]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"The pain is ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"constant"}],"; it never stops.\" (지속적인 통증)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-7 pl-2","children":["\"The pain ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"radiates"}]," to my lower back.\" (통증이 퍼지는 경우)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":"민지 씨는 YES 수업에서 배웠던 표현들을 떠올리며 자신의 복통이 '쥐어짜는 듯한 통증(Cramping)'이며, '음식을 먹을 때 더 악화된다(It gets worse when I eat)'는 점을 명확히 전달할 수 있었습니다. 덕분에 의사는 빠르게 맹장염 가능성을 배제하고 식중독 진단을 내릴 수 있었습니다."}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-2",{}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"className":"scroll-m-20 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight first:mt-0 mt-12 mb-6 text-gray-900","children":"3. 진단과 치료 계획, 놓치지 않고 이해하기"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-8 [&:not(:first-child)]:mt-6 text-gray-700 font-light text-lg","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"block my-8","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/images/blog/2026-01-25-medical-appointment-english-1-h2-3.jpg","alt":"3. 진단과 치료 계획, 놓치지 않고 이해하기","width":900,"height":500,"className":"rounded-[